# The image only COPYs files from docker/ (the workspace itself is bind-mounted
# at run time, JSBSim is cloned inside the image), so the build context is an
# allowlist: everything else — target/, build/, .git, controllers/rl,
# controllers/race, runs/, replays/, recordings/, tilecache/, .uv-cache/, … —
# never leaves the host.
*
!docker/
